{"id":"28ea14cb0d1e7474","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-inseparable-extension.md","title":"Deciding Formulas while Preserving Inseparability","display":"lem-inseparable-extension — Deciding Formulas while Preserving Inseparability","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-inseparable-extension","aliases":["89-lem-inseparable-extension"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"lem-inseparable-extension — Deciding Formulas while Preserving Inseparability","depends_on":["[[89-df-inseparable-pair]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-inseparable-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-inseparable-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-inseparable-extension — Deciding Formulas while Preserving Inseparability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"18a7d6d6f6148b37\" href=\"?note=18a7d6d6f6148b37\" title=\"89-df-inseparable-pair\">89-df-inseparable-pair</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,C\">\\(A,C\\)</span> 的有限闭包 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^{\\pm}\">\\(X^{\\pm}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MaxInsep}_{A,C}\">\\(\\mathrm{MaxInsep}_{A,C}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq X^{\\pm}\">\\(S\\subseteq X^{\\pm}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}(S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in X\">\\(D\\in X\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}inseparable\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}(S\\cup\\{D\\})\\lor\n\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}(S\\cup\\{\\neg D\\}),\\\\\n&amp;\\exists w\\in\\mathrm{MaxInsep}_{A,C}\\;(S\\subseteq w).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}inseparable\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}(S\\cup\\{D\\})\\lor\n\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}(S\\cup\\{\\neg D\\}),\\\\\n&amp;\\exists w\\in\\mathrm{MaxInsep}_{A,C}\\;(S\\subseteq w).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 119；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>若两个扩展分别由共同语言的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,B&#39;\">\\(B,B&#39;\\)</span> 分离，按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 所属语言构造分离 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的新公式。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 在共同语言，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(D\\to B)\\land(\\neg D\\to B&#39;)\">\\((D\\to B)\\land(\\neg D\\to B&#39;)\\)</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 仅在第 0 侧，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\lor B&#39;\">\\(B\\lor B&#39;\\)</span>；若仅在第 1 侧，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\land B&#39;\">\\(B\\land B&#39;\\)</span>。逐个真假情形的命题推理给原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0\">\\(S_0\\)</span> 蕴含它、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_1\">\\(S_1\\)</span> 蕴含其否定，矛盾。\n按有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的固定顺序依次应用第一式，取得第二式；原集合的公式始终保留。这里只做有限扩展，不调用无穷选择，也不把共同语言的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 随意放到一侧。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-inseparable-pair","status":"resolved","id":"18a7d6d6f6148b37","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-inseparable-pair]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,C","display":false},{"tex":"X^{\\pm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MaxInsep}_{A,C}","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq X^{\\pm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}inseparable\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}(S\\cup\\{D\\})\\lor\n\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}(S\\cup\\{\\neg D\\}),\\\\\n&\\exists w\\in\\mathrm{MaxInsep}_{A,C}\\;(S\\subseteq w).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"B,B'","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"(D\\to B)\\land(\\neg D\\to B')","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"B\\lor B'","display":false},{"tex":"B\\land B'","display":false},{"tex":"S_0","display":false},{"tex":"S_1","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false}],"bytes":1495,"backlinks":[{"id":"40d41bb5aac76af5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-137","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"第三种存在证明：[[89-df-inseparable-pair]] → [[89-lem-inseparable-extension]] → [[89-lem-inseparable-box-witness]] → [[89-thm-craig-interpolation]] → [[89-thm-beth-definability]] → [[89-thm-fixed-point-beth]]。"}],"outgoing":["18a7d6d6f6148b37"]}